<!-- Skeletal (fill-in) version of the section of the same name in the     -->
<!-- completed MATH 14 notes.  The two region types, the area formula and  -->
<!-- the reverse-order remark are kept; the four worked examples and the   -->
<!-- two Concept Check answers are replaced by blank workspace boxes.      -->
<!-- The boxes carried row labels naming the steps, and the examples and   -->
<!-- Concept Check questions a parenthetical how-to, until the instructor  -->
<!-- had those hints removed (Oct 2026): every box is now empty, and the   -->
<!-- examples and questions read as in the completed notes (Example IV     -->
<!-- keeps the bare labels Method 1 and Method 2).  File name and xml:ids  -->
<!-- are unchanged.                                                        -->
